# sigrok expect spi-1: A5
# sigrok expect spi-1: 3C C3
# sigrok annotations spi=miso-transfer
# sigrok expect spi-1: 5A 60 FF FF
# sigrok expect spi-1: 5A
# sigrok expect spi-1: 5A C3
# sigrok joins_after 100
# sigrok misread why CS is low from reset until the firmware starts, which sigrok reads as a transfer with no bytes
# sigrok misread at 0
# sigrok misread reads spi-1: 
# sigrok tooth flip:OUT0:0:0:16
# sigrok tooth shift:OUT2:2:-32
